  "caveats": [
   "Self-KO n = 402 transitions / 366 battles (0.46% of the corpus); the gate turns on it.",
   "FROZEN tokens: this tests the LOSS MECHANISM on a fixed representation, not the full training dynamics. A pass would license a fork A/B, never a ship.",
   "On the gamma=1.0 / G arm the metric DEGENERATES: G(t+1)-G(t) == -r(t) exactly, so the self-KO dV metric asks only 'can two states predict the reward of the step between them', and the TD residual there is a hard algebraic identity of the target. It is reported as a SECONDARY arm for that reason.",
   "The target is shaped-reward return-to-go, not the GAE/PopArt target the production critic actually regresses; absolute RMSEs are not comparable to any training metric.",
   "One frozen trunk (17.24M steps) scores traces from 2M-20M; early tiers' tokens come from a policy that did not play them (vdn_gate sanity Pearson 0.48 @2M vs 0.98 @16-18M)."
  ]
 }
